WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,240
Cui Zixuan helped transfer

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,840
Nothing will be found at the base

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,960
Just let them dispose of a corpse

4
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,760
You can also save yourself some energy

5
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,480
A strike or a sniff can bring a man to real tears

6
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,910
Then go away quickly

7
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:14,990
If you are discovered later, don’t tell me what I gave you.

8
00:00:14,990 --> 00:00:16,590
Okay, let's go now

9
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:20,480
Wu Xunji is not the kind of person who can like Su Wanwan

10
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:22,360
He's not someone who can be killed by beheading.

11
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:23,960
The incision on the waist is very deep

12
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,520
It seems like this is a fatal injury

13
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:27,360
There should be a lot of blood when you pull out the knife.

14
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,900
Why is there an incision on my neck?

15
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,900
Sun Tao, have you ever been a forensic doctor?

16
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:35,730
I always feel that the captain’s death is not that simple.

17
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:37,860
There is a deep incision on the waist

18
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,280
Look at the neck

19
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:41,440
A knife that can cut such a big wound on the waist

20
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:43,360
How can you leave such a small wound on your neck?
